  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NORHED II Women&apos;s, children&apos;s and nature&apos;s rights in env. gov.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim is to develop a masters and reserch program (Women&apos;s, Children&apos;s and Nature&apos;s Rights in Environm. Govern.), uniting students and scholars from Kenya, Malawi and Zimbabwe.It will involve online, live and practice-based learning and training in reserch methodology that will enable capacity development in reserch practice and which will focus on legal theory and governance practice needed to establish an evidencebased legal path towards the promotion og inclusive and sustainable development</narrative>
  </description>
